{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can explore through M (random map) to obtain crystals (suggestion) or kill bots to increase your money. When you have enough money, you can increase the value by using Q (the probability of summoning thunder to purchase sword weapons) or X (increasing the health limit). The core level of this game is S (Boss Battle), where you can challenge them at any time by using weapons (1. SMG, 2. ShootGun, 3. Sword) and some operations (press E to avoid damage when startled or use left Shift for some boss attacks) to defeat bosses. The above is the current version of the game gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047290?t=1759162950","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047290?t=1759162950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047290/ba49ca7c11c2d97cff3aefd27e53b79cc07da50b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759162950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047290/ba49ca7c11c2d97cff3aefd27e53b79cc07da50b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759162950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can explore through M (random map) to obtain crystals (suggestion) or kill bots to increase your money. When you have enough money, you can increase the value by using Q (the probability of summoning thunder to purchase sword weapons) or X (increasing the health limit). The core level of this game is S (Boss Battle), where you can challenge them at any time by using weapons (1. SMG, 2. ShootGun, 3. Sword) and some operations (press E to avoid damage when startled or use left Shift for some boss attacks) to defeat bosses. The above is the current version of the game gameplay.</p>","devel